## Getting unstuck

- Lost on what a feature should do? -> check `specs/` if it exists, or ask
- Lost on what's broken in code? -> [audits/README.md](audits/README.md) if the audit ran
- Lost on a specific rule? -> [{{RULES_PATH}}]({{RULES_PATH}}) or run `/x-rules <category>`
- Pre-commit hook blocking you? -> fix the violation; bypass `git commit --no-verify` only in emergencies (CI catches it anyway)

